      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What sort of reliability issue are you seeing? Do they not arrive or do they arrive out of order?\n\nIf it's order I've had similar issues and try to avoid \"Always\" as much as sanely possible. If you have any toggle or incremental triggers, see if you can change them to *idempotent* custom triggers that use \"AlwaysBufferOne\".\n\nNot only does this reduce the amount of events that need to be synced, it's also self-healing because if they arrive out of order, the next event will ensure everyone is on the same state.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
